  "content": "<!-- ====== HERO — Background image with left-aligned title ====== -->\n  <section class=\"hero hero--image\" style=\"background-image: url('https://plastic-craft.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/image_06.jpg');\">\n\n    <div class=\"hero__content\">\n      <p class=\"hero__label\">Industry Solutions</p>\n      <h1 class=\"hero__title\">Defense</h1>\n      <hr class=\"hero__divider\">\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ====== INTRO TEXT ====== -->\n  <section class=\"intro intro--tight\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"intro__content\">\n        <p>Our nation&rsquo;s defense system is the backbone of this country and it is vital that their equipment is manufactured to rigorous standards. Plastic-Craft&rsquo;s staff engineers work with industry-standard CAD software to create designs with exacting precision.</p>\n        <p>Our machinists can manufacture components to specifications with precise tolerances, and we can produce large quantities of consistent parts that meet and exceed strict government regulations.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ====== APPLICATIONS (Image + Tabbed Lists) ====== -->\n  <section class=\"applications\" id=\"applications\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"applications__layout\">\n\n        <!-- Featured Image -->\n        <div class=\"applications__image\">\n          <!-- PLACEHOLDER: Replace src with your own image -->\n          <img src=\"\" alt=\"Military defense plastics\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"background:#d0e9fd;min-height:480px;\">\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Application Lists -->\n        <div class=\"applications__body\">\n          <h2>Our Applications</h2>\n\n          <div class=\"applications__tabs\" role=\"tablist\">\n            <button class=\"applications__tab active\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-controls=\"panel-defense\" id=\"tab-defense\">Military Solutions</button>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Panel: Military Solutions -->\n          <div class=\"applications__panel active\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"panel-defense\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-defense\">\n            <ul class=\"applications__list\">\n              <li>Custom-fabricated parts for vehicles and equipment</li>\n              <li>Components meeting government regulations</li>\n              <li>High-impact resistant materials</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ====== MATERIALS (Banner bar + Tag Grid) ====== -->\n  <section class=\"materials\" id=\"materials\">\n    <div class=\"materials__banner\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <h2>Our Materials</h2>\n        <p>High-performance plastics engineered for military-grade applications</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"materials__grid\">\n      <span class=\"material-tag\">Acetal (POM)</span>\n      <span class=\"material-tag\">Polycarbonate (PC)</span>\n      <span class=\"material-tag\">Polyetheretherketone (PEEK)</span>\n      <span class=\"material-tag\">Polyethylene (PE)</span>\n      <span class=\"material-tag\">Polypropylene (PP)</span>\n      <span class=\"material-tag\">Polyvinyl Chloride (PVC)</span>\n      <span class=\"material-tag\">Phenolic</span>\n      <span class=\"material-tag\">UHMW Polyethylene</span>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ====== ADVANTAGES (Card Carousel) ====== -->\n  <section class=\"advantages\" id=\"advantages\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"advantages__header\">\n        <h2>Advantages of Using Plastic-Craft</h2>\n        <p>Precision-engineered plastics built to exceed military standards</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"advantages__carousel\">\n        <button class=\"advantages__arrow advantages__arrow--prev\" aria-label=\"Previous slide\">&larr;</button>\n        <button class=\"advantages__arrow advantages__arrow--next\" aria-label=\"Next slide\">&rarr;</button>\n\n        <div class=\"advantages__track\" id=\"advantagesTrack\">\n\n          <!-- Card 1 -->\n          <div class=\"advantage-card\">\n            <div class=\"advantage-card__icon\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"23\"/><path d=\"M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6\"/></svg>\n            </div>\n            <h3>Low Manufacturing Costs</h3>\n            <p>Cost-effective production for large quantities of consistent, precision-engineered components.</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Card 2 -->\n          <div class=\"advantage-card\">\n            <div class=\"advantage-card__icon\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z\"/></svg>\n            </div>\n            <h3>High Purity &amp; Low Friction</h3>\n            <p>High purity materials with low friction and wear for demanding mechanical applications.</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Card 3 -->\n          <div class=\"advantage-card\">\n            <div class=\"advantage-card__icon\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z\"/></svg>\n            </div>\n            <h3>Lightweight &amp; Durable</h3>\n            <p>Lightweight with excellent wear properties, resistant to high temperatures, impact, and chemicals.</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Card 4 -->\n          <div class=\"advantage-card\">\n            <div class=\"advantage-card__icon\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"14\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"/><rect x=\"3\" y=\"14\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"/></svg>\n            </div>\n            <h3>Color Coding &amp; Ergonomics</h3>\n            <p>Color coding options and easy-to-create ergonomic designs for specialized military equipment.</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Card 5 -->\n          <div class=\"advantage-card\">\n            <div class=\"advantage-card__icon\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"/></svg>\n            </div>\n            <h3>Thermal &amp; Chemical Stability</h3>\n            <p>Maintains physical properties under thermal, chemical, or electrical stress with excellent oxidative stability.</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Card 6 -->\n          <div class=\"advantage-card\">\n            <div class=\"advantage-card__icon\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4\"/><path d=\"M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 0 20 10 10 0 0 0 0-20z\"/></svg>\n            </div>\n            <h3>Regulatory Compliance</h3>\n            <p>Meets health regulations and precision dimensions. Can handle repeated sterilization with antimicrobial options.</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Card 7 -->\n          <div class=\"advantage-card\">\n            <div class=\"advantage-card__icon\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"/></svg>\n            </div>\n            <h3>Abrasion &amp; Shatter Resistant</h3>\n            <p>Abrasion and shatter resistant materials built for the toughest military environments.</p>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Carousel Dots -->\n      <div class=\"advantages__dots\" id=\"advantagesDots\"></div>\n\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ====== CTA / CONTACT ====== -->\n  <section class=\"cta-section\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <h2>Ready to Get Started?</h2>\n      <p>Our staff engineers are ready to create precision-engineered designs that meet and exceed strict government regulations.</p>\n      <div class=\"cta-section__actions\">\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn--primary\">Request a Quote</a>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn--outline\">Contact Our Team</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>",
